OL,11,     GThe BBC Philharmonic and Elena
OL,12,     GSchwarz in Mahler and Debussy.
OL,13,     GThey are joined by star
OL,14,     Gtrombonist Peter Moore for Dani
OL,15,     GHoward's Trombone Concerto.
